  "prompt": "Prepare to update the repository's version to {{version}}. First inspect the repository's build and release documentation, workspace configuration, manifests, and existing version scripts. Identify every independently buildable project and the version-bearing files it owns, including generated or lockfiles that must stay in sync. If there is more than one buildable project, list them and ask the user whether to update all of them or which specific projects to update. Wait for the answer before changing any files. For the selected projects, determine the required version format and create or update a repository script that validates its input and updates only the identified files. Run the script with {{version}}, add focused tests, and run relevant checks. Report the selected projects, files changed, and any failures."
}
